---
title: Instant Pot White and Brown Rice Blend
servings: 6
time required: 1 hour
tags: rice, side dish, instant pot, pressure cooker
description: A starting method for cooking equal parts white and brown rice together; timing and water are marked for dialing in.
---

Rinse the @brown rice{1%cup} and @white rice{1%cup} separately under cold water, then drain well. Use the same standard measuring cup for the rice and water, not the Instant Pot cup.

Put the brown rice and @water{1 1/4%cup} in the #Instant Pot{}. Lock the lid with the valve set to Sealing. Pressure Cook on High for ~brown rice first stage{17%minutes}.

When the timer ends, carefully quick-release the pressure. Open the lid away from you. Stir in the rinsed white rice and @water{1%cup}, scraping the bottom so no grains are stuck there.

Lock the lid with the valve set to Sealing. Pressure Cook on High for ~white rice second stage{4%minutes}. When the timer ends, leave the pot undisturbed for ~natural release{10%minutes}, then release any remaining pressure.

Fluff gently and serve. If the grains are still firm, add a splash of boiling water, close the lid, and rest for a few minutes; record the adjustment for the next batch.

> Starting point, not yet kitchen-tested: the brown rice gets about 21 minutes at pressure across both stages, while the white rice gets 4 minutes plus the natural release. Water is split as 1 1/4 cups for the brown rice and 1 cup for the white rice (1.25:1 and 1:1 by volume). Brown rice type, age, pot model, and your preferred texture can shift the result.
>
> Source blend — Instant Pot UK’s brown-rice guidance informed the 1.25:1 water ratio and 20-minute High-pressure baseline; Instant Pot Philippines’ guidance informed using manual Pressure Cook timing rather than the white-rice program for brown rice; The Kitchn’s tests informed the caution that rice and appliance results vary. The two-stage timing is my untested adaptation to give the brown rice its longer cook while limiting the white rice’s pressure time. https://instantpot.co.uk/brown-rice/ https://www.instantpot.com.ph/features/ https://www.thekitchn.com/instant-pot-rice-22949278
